. I spend my day making sure you don't disappear from the internet.\"\n            </p>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</section>\n<!-- How it works: Winding S-Curve -->\n<section class=\"py-40 bg-[#F0F4FF] overflow-hidden\" data-kid=\"8\" data-name=\"how it works section\" id=\"how-it-works\">\n    <div class=\"max-w-5xl mx-auto px-10 relative\" data-kid=\"8-1\" data-name=\"how it works container\">\n        <h2 class=\"font-outfit text-7xl font-black text-center mb-40 tracking-tight\" data-kid=\"8-1-1\" data-name=\"how it works headline\">\n            How it works\n        </h2>\n        <!-- S-Curve Background Path -->\n        <svg class=\"absolute top-[300px] left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 w-full h-full pointer-events-none opacity-20\" data-kid=\"8-1-2\" data-name=\"s-curve background svg\" fill=\"none\" preserveaspectratio=\"xMidYMin slice\" viewbox=\"0 0 800 1600\">\n            <path d=\"M400,0 C400,300 100,300 100,600 C100,900 700,900 700,1200 C700,1500 400,1500 400,1800\" stroke=\"#1F5EFF\" stroke-dasharray=\"24 24\" stroke-width=\"8\">\n            </path>\n        </svg>\n        <div class=\"flex flex-col gap-[400px] relative z-10\" data-kid=\"8-1-3\" data-name=\"steps list container\">\n            <!-- Step 1 -->\n            <div class=\"step-blob flex items-center gap-16\" data-kid=\"8-1-3-1\" data-name=\"step 1 container\">\n                <div class=\"w-32 h-32 bg-[#FFE600] rounded-full flex items-center justify-center text-5xl font-black shadow-2xl shrink-0 rotate-6 border-4 border-white\" data-kid=\"8-1-3-1-1\" data-name=\"step 1 number bubble\">\n                    1\n                </div>\n                <div data-kid=\"8-1-3-1-2\" data-name=\"step 1 text container\">\n                    <h3 class=\"text-5xl font-black font-outfit mb-4 tracking-tight\" data-kid=\"8-1-3-1-2-1\" data-name=\"step 1 headline\">\n                        Teach me who you are.\n                    </h3>\n                    <p class=\"text-2xl text-black/50 font-medium leading-relaxed\" data-kid=\"8-1-3-1-2-2\" data-name=\"step 1 description\">\n                        Connect your accounts and let me learn your values, your niche, and your authentic style.\n                    </p>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n            <!-- Step 2 -->\n            <div class=\"step-blob flex items-center gap-16 flex-row-reverse text-right\" data-kid=\"8-1-3-2\" data-name=\"step 2 container\">\n                <div class=\"w-32 h-32 bg-[#FF99A8] rounded-full flex items-center justify-center text-5xl font-black shadow-2xl shrink-0 -rotate-12 border-4 border-white\" data-kid=\"8-1-3-2-1\" data-name=\"step 2 number bubble\">\n                    2\n                </div>\n                <div data-kid=\"8-1-3-2-2\" data-name=\"step 2 text container\">\n                    <h3 class=\"text-5xl font-black font-outfit mb-4 tracking-tight\" data-kid=\"8-1-3-2-2-1\" data-name=\"step 2 headline\">\n                        Talk to me naturally.\n                    </h3>\n                    <p class=\"text-2xl text-black/50 font-medium leading-relaxed\" data-kid=\"8-1-3-2-2-2\" data-name=\"step 2 description\">\n                        Just tell me what's on your mind. No prompt engineering needed. I get you.\n                    </p>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n            <!-- Step 3 -->\n            <div class=\"step-blob flex items-center gap-16\" data-kid=\"8-1-3-3\" data-name=\"step 3 container\">\n                <div class=\"w-32 h-32 bg-[#B2F5EA] rounded-full flex items-center justify-center text-5xl font-black shadow-2xl shrink-0 rotate-[15deg] border-4 border-white\" data-kid=\"8-1-3-3-1\" data-name=\"step 3 number bubble\">\n                    3\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"flex flex-col gap-8\" data-kid=\"8-1-3-3-2\" data-name=\"step 3 text container\">\n                    <div data-kid=\"8-1-3-3-2-1\" data-name=\"step 3 text body\">\n                        <h3 class=\"text-5xl font-black font-outfit mb-4 tracking-tight\" data-kid=\"8-1-3-3-2-1-1\" data-name=\"step 3 headline\">\n                            Go build while I handle the internet.\n                        </h3>\n                        <p class=\"text-2xl text-black/50 font-medium leading-relaxed\" data-kid=\"8-1-3-3-2-1-2\" data-name=\"step 3 description\">\n                            I take care of the posting, replying, and networking while you build real things.\n                        </p>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"relative max-w-md\" data-kid=\"8-1-3-3-2-2\" data-name=\"step 3 video wrapper\">\n                        <video autoplay=\"\" class=\"rounded-[2.5rem] shadow-[0_30px_60px_rgba(0,0,0,0.15)] border-8 border-white\" data-kid=\"8-1-3-3-2-2-1\" data-name=\"step 3 demo video\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://kombai-assets.b-cdn.net/generated_assets/a7c4744a00cd4566a7f68ea41d9ae9f2.jpg\" preload=\"metadata\" src=\"https://kombai-assets.b-cdn.net/generated_assets/134183b3-7657-46b7-aa44-253d94a33dc8/3bbf8441ba0f4b35b19d51d40dc554b1.mp4\">\n                        </video>\n                        <div class=\"absolute -top-6 -right-6 bg-[#1F5EFF] text-white px-4 py-2 rounded-xl font-black text-sm rotate-12 shadow-lg\" data-kid=\"8-1-3-3-2-2-2\" data-name=\"active status tag\">\n                            ACTIVE\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</section>\n<!-- Today vs Tomorrow Section -->\n<section class=\"py-40 bg-white\" data-kid=\"9\" data-name=\"comparison section\">\n    <div class=\"max-w-6xl mx-auto px-10\" data-kid=\"9-1\" data-name=\"comparison container\">\n        <h2 class=\"font-outfit text-6xl font-black text-center mb-24 tracking-tight\" data-kid=\"9-1-1\" data-name=\"comparison section headline\">\n            Today vs Tomorrow\n        </h2>\n        <div class=\"comparison-container group 